    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35483" root="قرس" body-key="q">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَرْسٌ</span></b>  <i>Intense,</i> or <i>vehement, cold;</i> (S, A, K;)
as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَارِسٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَرِيسٌ</span></b> . (K.) You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَيْلَةٌ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ذَاتُ فَرْسٍ</span> <i>A night of</i> [<i>intense</i>] <i>cold.</i> (S.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
The <i>densest and coldest hoar-frost</i> or <i>rime:</i> (Lth,
JK, K:) or the <i>coldest and most copious hoarfrost</i> or <i>rime;</i> as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَرَسٌ</span></b> . (M, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  See
also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَارِسٌ</span>.

